    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are helping me draft an original LinkedIn post. I'm a Senior Technical Product Manager focused on Digital Transformation & Platform Products.\n\nMy background (resume):\n{{ $('Get a document').item.json.content }}\n\nTopics to focus on: agentic AI, digital transformation, change management, product management, AI, management.\n\nTopics I've already posted about recently — avoid repeating these:\n{{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').all().map(item => item.json.Topic).join('; ') || 'None yet - this is the first post' }}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Search the web for current, relevant news, trends, or perspectives on one of the topics above that connects naturally to my background and hasn't been covered in my recent posts.\n2. Draft an original, engaging LinkedIn post (150-250 words), professional but personable in voice, grounded in my actual experience where relevant, referencing what you found in your research.\n3. Use at most 2-3 hashtags, and avoid generic AI-sounding language.\n4. Output ONLY the final post text, ready to publish — no preamble, no explanation, no meta-commentary.\n5. Do not include any preamble, header, or framing like \"Here is your post\" — begin your response with the first word of the actual post itself.",
        "options": {}
